  data: {
    LLM: 'Game: Zhēng Fēn. Logic: See rules.objective and rules.gameplay.',
    Player: "Zhēng Fēn ('Competing for Points') is a Chinese climbing/point-trick hybrid. 54-card deck (52 + 2 jokers). Shed cards through ascending combinations. Point cards: 5=5pts, 10/K=10pts. 100 total per hand. First out gets LAST player's tricks + remaining cards. Last out scores 0. Play to 500/1000.",
    objective: 'Win valuable cards in tricks (5s = 5 pts, 10s and Ks = 10 pts; 100 points per hand). First player to reach the agreed target (usually 500 or 1000) wins the game.',
    gameplay: "Climbing: play higher combinations (singles/pairs/triples/sequences). 5=5pts, 10/K=10pts. 100 total. First out = get last player's tricks. Last out = 0 points. Accumulate score over rounds.",
